### *Async events (master → host)*
Master forwards bath/sampler traffic, including:
- `#PRE-DONE,ACK*` · `#END-TEST,ACK*` · `#LF-CL-HOME,ACK*` · `#RECIPE,ACK*`
- `#CMT,…,ACK*` · `#ERR,…,ACK*`
- `#SMP-AUTO,ST-n,SV-x,FH-y*` — auto sample when probe arm goes DOWN
Typical full-test sequence from the host device:
#RECIPE,TEMP-37.0,TS-02,RPM-1-100,2-100,DUR-1-00:05,2-00:05,SML-1-10,2-10,FL-1-2,2-2*
#PRE-HEAT*
 … wait #PRE-DONE,ACK*
#START-TEST*
 … wait #SMP-AUTO… / #CMT… per step, then #END-TEST,ACK*
Flash *master_URAT* only. Host UART cheat-sheet is also on the new *Host UART* web tab.